Dear All,

Recently I found an interesting paper about problems with RMA when 
applied to small sample sets which are based on the median-polish 
algorithm, see:
http://www.biomedcentral.com/1471-2105/11/553/abstract

Since the authors offer a simple solution to the problem I thought it 
might be of interest to users that I have implemented function "trma()" 
in the development version "xps_1.11.3".

Best regards
Christian
