I also reacted yesterday. Apparently, it came not through. I created a CDF-environment for Mouse Gene ST v 1.1 that properly takes the dimensions into account. I attached the source file to this email. People whom need a windows library should contact me :-).

Anyway: to utilize the cdf-library properly, you need to install the (currently) development version of affy and affyio: 

http://bioconductor.org/help/bioc-views/2.8/bioc/html/affy.html (version 1.29.1)
http://bioconductor.org/help/bioc-views/2.8/bioc/html/affyio.html (version 1.19.2)

