We don't presently have any Agilent annotation packages for fly, but if
you have a mapping of probes to genes from the manufacturer, you can
easily generate one using the code in AnnotationDbi.  There is a
vignette that explains how to do this called SQLForge in the
AnnotationDbi package.  You can find it here:

